@OrderRouter_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5019

###

# Authenticate in Development with the dev key (set it with `dotnet user-secrets` or the .env file; never commit it).
@devApiKey = {{$processEnv DEV_API_KEY}}

### Any protected endpoint accepts the key in X-Api-Key (production uses a JWT bearer token instead)
GET {{OrderRouter_Api_HostAddress}}/health
X-Api-Key: {{devApiKey}}
